<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Baobab to split shares ten-for-one.</title>
<headline>Baobab to split shares ten-for-one.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Baobab Solid Growth Ltd said on Friday it would split its shares on a ten-for-one basis on September 29.</p>
<p>The move will come into effect as the group changes its name to Theta Group and its listing moves to the Johannesburg Stock Exchange's banks sector.</p>
<p>The financial services firm's stock price has shot up in the last two years from 500 cents to 65.00 rand.</p>
